 all add up to the total wordcount of the pantheon, every one of those previewed is going to need to be massaged to lose text from some areas and fit the others in.</div> </div> </div> </div>PSPs and Virtues are covered elsewhere.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Neall Raemonn Price</span><br /> Beleaguered Scion Developer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/137-neall","name":"Neall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1204"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-05T13:43:00-08:00","id":1012757,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Neall</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1010419-pantheon-preview-the-teotl?p=1012500#post1012500\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> PSPs and Virtues are covered elsewhere.</div> </div> </div> </div>So the 7.5k word limit is mostly referring to the fluff and god writeups? Which is fine, but when you said each thing we got was complete (if not necessarily a final draft) I got worried about how much space was going to need to be cut from some things to fit in obligatory stuff every pantheon has. I didn't stop and do a word count of each document which would have probably more helpfully shown that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12